	<h2 class="display-4">IP to Country Lite</h2>
	<p>The free IP to Country Lite database is a subset of the <a href="/db/ip-to-country">IP to Country</a> database with reduced coverage and accuracy distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution License.</p>
	<p>Our IP to Country Lite database is updated monthly and available in <b>CSV</b> and <b>MMDB</b> formats.</p>
	<br /><hr /><br />
	<h2 class="display-4">Available information in the IP to Country Lite database</h2>
	<p>The IP to Country Lite database contains a set of IP address ranges with the following details :</p>
